Lab patch for Strix 685bbc8 (v1.7.1), applied at image build.

Why: Strix keeps its agent graph (agents.json) and the SDK sessions (agents.db) in
strix_runs/<run>/.state (strix/core/paths.py 9). Evidence collection refuses hidden
names, so the folder is renamed to state; every reader goes through
runtime_state_dir(), so nothing else changes.

diff --git a/strix/core/paths.py b/strix/core/paths.py
index 2cd7ba0b..6f152bdb 100644
--- a/strix/core/paths.py
+++ b/strix/core/paths.py
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@ from pathlib import Path
 
 
 RUNS_DIR_NAME = "strix_runs"
-RUNTIME_STATE_DIR_NAME = ".state"
+RUNTIME_STATE_DIR_NAME = "state"  # lab patch: evidence keeps no hidden names
 RUN_RECORD_FILENAME = "run.json"
 
 
